# Battle against Zacian (the hero of the sword, a wolf with a blade in its jaws): a trumpet's call over trembling
# violin, then the heroes' knightly fanfare, a dotted leap up a fourth, carried by a sharp E-minor violin over strings
# and a marching snare. Original composition for this game.
